{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16709","headline":"醉後寄山中友人 · 于鹄","name":"醉後寄山中友人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"昨日山家春酒浓，野人相劝久从容。\n独忆卸冠眠细草，不知谁送出深松。\n都忘醉後逢廉度，不省归时见鲁恭。\n知己尚嫌身酩酊，路人应恐笑龙锺。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"于鹄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16709.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16709","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}